ViridianCity_School_Text_TryingToMemorizeNotes::
    .string "I have to have the table by\n"
    .string "Friday.\p"
    .string "I do not have to understand it.\p"
    .string "I have to have it.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadBlackboardCarefully::
    .string "Right.\p"
    .string "Read the board properly.\n"
    .string "It is all on the board.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFirstPage::
    .string "Let us look at the notebook.\p"
    .string "First page.\p"
    .string "There are fifteen kinds.\p"
    .string "Every daemon is one of them, or\n"
    .string "two of them.\p"
    .string "Its kind decides what it can answer\n"
    .string "and what it cannot.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookSecondPage::
    .string "Second page.\p"
    .string "Some kinds land twice as hard.\p"
    .string "LOGIC on CONTENT. FLOW on\n"
    .string "ENTROPY. CORRUPT on GROWTH.\p"
    .string "Learn the table.\n"
    .string "It does not change.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookThirdPage::
    .string "Third page.\p"
    .string "Some kinds cannot reach at all.\p"
    .string "CONTENT cannot touch LATENT.\n"
    .string "Neither can LOGIC.\p"
    .string "Nothing either one does will\n"
    .string "register.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFourthPage::
    .string "Fourth page.\p"
    .string "The eight benchmarks test whether\n"
    .string "you know the table.\p"
    .string "Pass all eight and the REVIEW\n"
    .string "BOARD will see you.\p"
    .string "That is the whole of the path.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_TurnThePage::
    .string "Turn the page?$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_HeyDontLookAtMyNotes::
    .string "GIRL: Hey.\n"
    .string "Those are my notes.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_BlackboardListsStatusProblems::
    .string "The board lists what can go wrong\n"
    .string "with a daemon mid-battle.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadWhichTopic::
    .string "Which one?$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainSleep::
    .string "Asleep, nothing runs.\p"
    .string "The battle ending does not wake\n"
    .string "it.\p"
    .string "AWAKENING is the interrupt.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainBurn::
    .string "Burned, it hits softer and loses\n"
    .string "HP each turn.\p"
    .string "Carried out of the battle with it.\p"
    .string "BURN HEAL.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainPoison::
    .string "Poisoned, HP drains and does not\n"
    .string "stop.\p"
    .string "Carried out of the battle with it.\p"
    .string "ANTIDOTE.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainFreeze::
    .string "Frozen, it cannot act at all.\p"
    .string "Nothing left to try.\p"
    .string "Carried out of the battle with it.\p"
    .string "ICE HEAL.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainParalysis::
    .string "Paralysed, it is slower and may\n"
    .string "not act at all.\p"
    .string "Carried out of the battle with it.\p"
    .string "PARLYZ HEAL.$"

